    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为是自己爱吃的东西\n就抢别人的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有只野生的电飞鼠让我很头疼。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A662F81EA5DF17231540376844E1C897F000A5C3162A2522B4EBA76842026202600100001BE00000A670953EA91CE751F7684753598DE9F208BA962115F88593475BC3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那家伙还逃得飞快，\n好多人都被它害惨咯。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35BB64F198FD890035F9798DE5FEBFF0C000A597D591A4EBA90FD88AB5B835BB360E854AF3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说啊……\n你在ZA登峰战也很厉害对吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n给电飞鼠展示一下你的实力，\n让它变得老实点吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4554A20262026000A4F605728005A0041767B5CF062184E5F5F8853895BB35BF95427FF1F00100001BE01000A7ED9753598DE9F205C55793A4E004E0B4F6076845B9E529BFF0C000A8BA95B8353D85F9780015B9E70B954273002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是打倒它\n还是把它捉住，都随你。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F625350125B83000A8FD8662F628A5B8363494F4FFF0C90FD968F4F603002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带一提，那只抢东西的\n电飞鼠喜欢桃桃果。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E264E0063D0FF0C90A353EA62A24E1C897F7684000A753598DE9F20559C6B2268436843679C3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "飞咻咻！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98DE54BB54BBFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话还没说完呢，\n我的桃桃果就又被它抢走了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8FD86CA18BF45B8C5462FF0C000A6211768468436843679C5C3153C888AB5B8362A28D704E86FF01001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帮我去追那只电飞鼠吧！\n用洛托姆滑翔应该就能追上它。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
