      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人也好，宝可梦也好，\n都一样在拼命地生存啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
